WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:05.420
Very very deep beneath the dark Kingdom of Grounds

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.380
lived a little worm

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:12.680
who everyone would always laugh at because of his farting problem

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:20.400
Ashamed and humiliated he lay down at his pond of tears

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:25.440
Unaware that he would soon give birth to great miracles

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.240
Poopdie was his name

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.040
and what a great name it was

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.240
*backwatds gibberish*

